Changes to github.com/yzhou216/flake under test, as a diff against
1dd2043, under the terms of that repository:

  bbf020f systems: import the shared modules through one module
  ecb9527 shell: enable tmux for nixos and darwin alike
  6fe13ba shell: check for darwin through stdenv.hostPlatform
  0402206 man: set the nixos-only developer documentation in commons
  3ceb088 darwin: drop nix-init, which dev.nix installs

diff --git a/systems/commons.nix b/systems/commons.nix
